--- signature of philosophers, parameterized by their number

fmod PHIL is
 protecting NAT .
 sort Phil .
 op ph : Nat NzNat -> Phil [ctor] . --- the i-th philosopher modulo N (i.e., ph(i) = ph(i rem N))
 var X : Nat . var N : NzNat .
 ceq ph(X, N) = ph(X rem N, N) if X >= N . --- mod-N 
endfm

view Phil from TRIV to PHIL is 
 sort Elt to Phil . 
endv